      en: ["Historical center of coffee cultivation on São Tomé.", "The name derives from a Portuguese family name.", "The soils are ideal for growing Arabica coffee.", "Hiking trails lead through tunnels of bamboo and giant ferns.", "Nearby is the famous Roça de Monte Café.", "The cooler temperatures at altitude were ideal for the European plantation owners.", "Important habitat for the São Tomé white-eye."]
